			{"id":"d-escrever-dica","type":"text","x":40,"y":730,"width":1320,"height":140.4,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-escrever","text":"Plain Markdown, Obsidian-compatible: headings that fold, tables (drag a column's width in the header), tasks, highlights, KaTeX formulas and Mermaid diagrams. Reading, Edit and Source: ⌘E switches between the first two. A / at the start of a line inserts blocks, and Verso saves on its own.","originalText":"Plain Markdown, Obsidian-compatible: headings that fold, tables (drag a column's width in the header), tasks, highlights, KaTeX formulas and Mermaid diagrams. Reading, Edit and Source: ⌘E switches between the first two. A / at the start of a line inserts blocks, and Verso saves on its own.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-blocos-dica","type":"text","x":1690,"y":730,"width":1320,"height":105.3,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-blocos","text":"In Edit mode, every paragraph, list item or heading is a block: hover and drag the ⋮⋮ in the margin to move it, or click it to turn into, duplicate, copy the link or delete. The + opens the / menu on a new block. The file stays plain Markdown.","originalText":"In Edit mode, every paragraph, list item or heading is a block: hover and drag the ⋮⋮ in the margin to move it, or click it to turn into, duplicate, copy the link or delete. The + opens the / menu on a new block. The file stays plain Markdown.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
