			{"id":"d-blocos-k31-t","type":"text","x":2503,"y":543.5,"width":54,"height":35,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-blocos","text":"/","originalText":"/","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d-blocos-k31","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-blocos-w3","type":"text","x":2596,"y":545,"width":165,"height":37.5,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-blocos","text":"turn into…","originalText":"turn into…","fontSize":30,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-conectar-dica","type":"text","x":3340,"y":730,"width":1320,"height":175.5,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-conectar","text":"Type [[ and a note's name to link the two: the other one gets a backlink, and ![[note]] shows the whole note inside this one. Hold the pointer over a link and the note appears in a card, without leaving where you are. ⌘⇧G opens the open note's relations; the graph of the whole folder is in the left strip. Unlinked mentions, in the right pane: Link links right there; Link all shows what changes first.","originalText":"Type [[ and a note's name to link the two: the other one gets a backlink, and ![[note]] shows the whole note inside this one. Hold the pointer over a link and the note appears in a card, without leaving where you are. ⌘⇧G opens the open note's relations; the graph of the whole folder is in the left strip. Unlinked mentions, in the right pane: Link links right there; Link all shows what changes first.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-organizar-dica","type":"text","x":40,"y":2030,"width":860,"height":140.4,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-organizar","text":"The properties at the top of a note become the columns of a base: table, cards, list, kanban, calendar or map. ⌘⇧D opens today's note, made from the Daily template; the week and the month have theirs, in the palette and in the calendar.","originalText":"The properties at the top of a note become the columns of a base: table, cards, list, kanban, calendar or map. ⌘⇧D opens today's note, made from the Daily template; the week and the month have theirs, in the palette and in the calendar.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-base-w","type":"text","x":960,"y":2130,"width":308,"height":35,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-organizar","text":"open the base with ↗","originalText":"open the base with ↗","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-tipos-dica","type":"text","x":1690,"y":2030,"width":1320,"height":140.4,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-tipos","text":"A note with type: character gets the form of the type's schema: the declared properties first, with the right label and field. What does not fit is marked, the empty row only writes when you fill it in, and type:character searches the notes of the type. With layout: infobox in the schema, the properties become a sheet beside the text — open Places/Gray Harbor.","originalText":"A note with type: character gets the form of the type's schema: the declared properties first, with the right label and field. What does not fit is marked, the empty row only writes when you fill it in, and type:character searches the notes of the type. With layout: infobox in the schema, the properties become a sheet beside the text — open Places/Gray Harbor.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-tipos-w","type":"text","x":1690,"y":2130,"width":662.2,"height":35,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-tipos","text":"the schema lives in a note: Types/Character","originalText":"the schema lives in a note: Types/Character","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-encontrar-dica","type":"text","x":3340,"y":2030,"width":1320,"height":105.3,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-encontrar","text":"Search the notes accepts tag:, path: and file:. Find and replace in the folder (⌘⇧H) shows every change before it writes. ‹ and › — or ⌘[ and ⌘] — go back the way you came; the right panel (⌘⌥→, or the button at the top-right corner) has backlinks, tags and bookmarks.","originalText":"Search the notes accepts tag:, path: and file:. Find and replace in the folder (⌘⇧H) shows every change before it writes. ‹ and › — or ⌘[ and ⌘] — go back the way you came; the right panel (⌘⌥→, or the button at the top-right corner) has backlinks, tags and bookmarks.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
