			{"id":"d-arq-k31-t","type":"text","x":2503,"y":3093.5,"width":54,"height":35,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-arquivos","text":"⌫","originalText":"⌫","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"d-arq-k31","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-arq-w3","type":"text","x":2596,"y":3095,"width":198,"height":37.5,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-arquivos","text":"to the trash","originalText":"to the trash","fontSize":30,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-ver-dica","type":"text","x":3800,"y":3250,"width":860,"height":140.4,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-ver","text":"PDFs, images and SVG open in tabs and live on cards. Double-click the PDF to scroll and search it right here; in the tab, Quote the selection in the notes saves the passage in a note beside the PDF. See Documents and Media.","originalText":"PDFs, images and SVG open in tabs and live on cards. Double-click the PDF to scroll and search it right here; in the tab, Quote the selection in the notes saves the passage in a note beside the PDF. See Documents and Media.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-web-dica","type":"text","x":40,"y":4630,"width":1320,"height":105.3,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-web","text":"A note with the url property is a web page, with your notes below it. An .html in the folder opens as a page, without scripts; an <iframe> embeds a site in the middle of the note, once you allow it.","originalText":"A note with the url property is a web page, with your notes below it. An .html in the folder opens as a page, without scripts; an <iframe> embeds a site in the middle of the note, once you allow it.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-boards-dica","type":"text","x":2410,"y":4330,"width":600,"height":421.2,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-boards","text":"A board is a .canvas, the same file as Obsidian's, drawn with Excalidraw. Notes, images and PDFs come in as live cards; an arrow between two cards is a canvas connection, and between two notes it can become a relation.\n• ⇄ swaps a card's file\n• ⌘⇧E exports the board as an image\n• ⌘F searches the board\n• An image becomes a map, with pins that open notes\n• Text, in the tab's corner, shows the JSON","originalText":"A board is a .canvas, the same file as Obsidian's, drawn with Excalidraw. Notes, images and PDFs come in as live cards; an arrow between two cards is a canvas connection, and between two notes it can become a relation.\n• ⇄ swaps a card's file\n• ⌘⇧E exports the board as an image\n• ⌘F searches the board\n• An image becomes a map, with pins that open notes\n• Text, in the tab's corner, shows the JSON","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-treino-nota","type":"text","x":2550,"y":3770,"width":376.2,"height":45,"strokeColor":"#e03131","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"text":"learn to draw here!","originalText":"learn to draw here!","fontSize":36,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{
				"id":"d-treino-seta",
				"type":"arrow",
				"x":2800,
				"y":3820,
				"width":30,
				"height":200,
				"strokeColor":"#e03131",
