				"fillStyle":"solid",
				"strokeWidth":2,
				"strokeStyle":"solid",
				"roughness":0,
				"opacity":100,
				"roundness":{"type":3},
				"frameId":"g-terminal"
			},
			{"id":"d-terminal-t","type":"text","x":770,"y":5390,"width":720,"height":144,"strokeColor":"#b2f2bb","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-terminal","text":"$ verso search ~/Notes meeting\nTemplates/Meeting Note.md: …\n\n$ verso backlinks ~/Notes \"projects/Project Alpha\"\nDaily/2026-09-24.md: 22:3  [[Project Alpha]]","originalText":"$ verso search ~/Notes meeting\nTemplates/Meeting Note.md: …\n\n$ verso backlinks ~/Notes \"projects/Project Alpha\"\nDaily/2026-09-24.md: 22:3  [[Project Alpha]]","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.2},
			{"id":"d-ajuda-dica","type":"text","x":1690,"y":5960,"width":620,"height":175.5,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-ajuda","text":"The bell, in the status bar, keeps the notifications; Report a problem, beside it, prepares a report for you to copy; ⌥⌘I opens the console. On Windows and Linux, Ctrl instead of ⌘.","originalText":"The bell, in the status bar, keeps the notifications; Report a problem, beside it, prepares a report for you to copy; ⌥⌘I opens the console. On Windows and Linux, Ctrl instead of ⌘.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
			{"id":"d-atalhos-lista","type":"text","x":1690,"y":5340,"width":424.32,"height":413.1,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-ajuda","text":"⌘⇧P  commands\n⌘P  open by name\n⌘K  search the notes\n⌘N  new note\n⌘⇧D  today's note\n⌘E  read or edit\n⌘\\  split the screen\n⌘[  ⌘]  back and forward\n⌘,  settings","originalText":"⌘⇧P  commands\n⌘P  open by name\n⌘K  search the notes\n⌘N  new note\n⌘⇧D  today's note\n⌘E  read or edit\n⌘\\  split the screen\n⌘[  ⌘]  back and forward\n⌘,  settings","fontSize":34,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35},
			{"id":"d-organizacao-dica","type":"text","x":3340,"y":5930,"width":1320,"height":105.3,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-organizacao","text":"Stickers, colors and covers highlight notes and folders in the tree and in the header. Order items by hand or pin them to the folder; edit embedded notes in place and type : to suggest emoji in the text.","originalText":"Stickers, colors and covers highlight notes and folders in the tree and in the header. Order items by hand or pin them to the folder; edit embedded notes in place and type : to suggest emoji in the text.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
