			{"id":"d-org-w3","type":"text","x":4149,"y":5745,"width":280.5,"height":37.5,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-organizacao","text":"close suggestions","originalText":"close suggestions","fontSize":30,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.25},
			{"id":"d-focos-dica","type":"text","x":40,"y":7230,"width":1320,"height":105.3,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"frameId":"g-focos","text":"Focuses are named roots of the file tree, compatible with make.md. Pick a focus to see the tree from it; Home shows the whole folder. The Focuses tab in the right pane creates, renames, reorders and changes the sticker of each focus.","originalText":"Focuses are named roots of the file tree, compatible with make.md. Pick a focus to see the tree from it; Home shows the whole folder. The Focuses tab in the right pane creates, renames, reorders and changes the sticker of each focus.","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","lineHeight":1.35,"autoResize":false},
